<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GCC raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GCC raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming said on Friday it had raised its rating for Mexico's Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua SA de CV to long-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a report, the firm said Mexican domestic cement demand was picking up but U.S. operations may not repeat 1996's strong growth.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
